# No Cursor attribution

Never add Cursor attribution to commits or PRs:

- No `Made with Cursor` / `Made-with: Cursor` footers
- No `Co-authored-by: Cursor` trailers
- No `--trailer` for Cursor attribution on `git commit`
- No attribution text in PR bodies
